    {
      "id": "R-I2C-001",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "I2C 主机总线用 i2c_new_master_bus() 创建，返回 i2c_master_bus_handle_t，不要用旧版 i2c_driver_install()",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "@brief Allocate an I2C master bus"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": {
        "type": "api_exists",
        "symbol": "i2c_new_master_bus",
        "header": "driver/i2c_master.h"
      },
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-002",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c",
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "每个从设备用 i2c_master_bus_add_device() 挂到总线上，得到 i2c_master_dev_handle_t 后再收发",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "esp_err_t i2c_master_bus_add_device(i2c_master_bus_handle_t bus_handle, const i2c_device_config_t *dev_config, i2c_master_dev_handle_t *ret_handle);"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": {
        "type": "api_exists",
        "symbol": "i2c_master_bus_add_device",
        "header": "driver/i2c_master.h"
      },
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-003",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c",
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "读器件寄存器用 i2c_master_transmit_receive()（先写寄存器地址再读），不要自己拼 START/STOP 序列",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "esp_err_t i2c_master_transmit_receive(i2c_master_dev_handle_t i2c_dev, const uint8_t *write_buffer, size_t write_size, uint8_t *read_buffer, size_t read_size, int xfer_ti"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": {
        "type": "api_exists",
        "symbol": "i2c_master_transmit_receive",
        "header": "driver/i2c_master.h"
      },
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-004",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c",
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "设备配置里 device_address 填 7 位原始地址，不含读写位；MPU6050（AD0 接低）填 0x68",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "uint16_t device_address;                    /*!< I2C device raw address. (The 7/10 bit address without read/write bit)."
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": {
        "type": "api_exists",
