      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-005",
      "kind": "pin",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "总线引脚在 i2c_master_bus_config_t 里设置：sda_io_num=GPIO4（硬件档案），scl_io_num=GPIO5（硬件档案）",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "gpio_num_t sda_io_num;                /*!< GPIO number of I2C SDA signal, pulled-up internally */"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-006",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "i2c_port 填 -1 表示由驱动自动选择 I2C 端口",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "i2c_port_num_t i2c_port;              /*!< I2C port number, `-1` for auto selecting"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-007",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "每个设备的 SCL 频率单独在 i2c_device_config_t.scl_speed_hz 里设置，不要指望总线级统一速率",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "uint32_t scl_speed_hz;                      /*!< I2C SCL line frequency. */"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-008",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "glitch_ignore_cnt 典型填 7，用于滤除线上的窄毛刺（单位 I2C 模块时钟周期）",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "typically value is 7 (unit: I2C module clock cycle)"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-009",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "不要依赖内部上拉跑高速率：内部上拉强度不足，高速时须外加外部上拉电阻（enable_internal_pullup 仅作辅助）",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-master-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_master.h",
        "quote": "Enable internal pullups. Note: This is not strong enough to pullup buses under high-speed frequency. Recommend proper external pull-up if possible"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-I2C-010",
      "kind": "api",
      "scope": [
        "i2c"
      ],
      "text": "ACK/NACK 取值：I2C_ACK_VAL = 0、I2C_NACK_VAL = 1，读操作末字节用 i2c_ack_value_t 指定",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "idf-driver-i2c-types-h",
        "page": null,
        "section": "i2c_types.h",
        "quote": "I2C_ACK_VAL = 0,  /**< Acknowledge (ACK) signal */"
      },
      "tier": "official_code",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MPU-001",
      "kind": "sequence",
      "scope": [
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "初始化第一步：向 PWR_MGMT_1（0x6B）写 DEVICE_RESET=1 复位全部寄存器，等该位自动清 0 后再配置",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "mpu6050-rm",
        "page": 42,
        "section": "4.30 PWR_MGMT_1 / DEVICE_RESET",
        "quote": "When set to 1, this bit resets all internal registers to their default values."
      },
      "tier": "official_mirror",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MPU-002",
      "kind": "sequence",
      "scope": [
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "复位后必须把 PWR_MGMT_1 的 SLEEP 位清 0 退出睡眠，否则传感器不出数据",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "mpu6050-rm",
        "page": 42,
        "section": "4.30 PWR_MGMT_1 / SLEEP",
        "quote": "SLEEP When set to 1, this bit puts the MPU-60X0 into sleep mode."
      },
      "tier": "official_mirror",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MPU-003",
      "kind": "register",
      "scope": [
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "PWR_MGMT_1 的 CLKSEL 应选陀螺 PLL 作为时钟参考（如 CLKSEL=1，X 轴陀螺 PLL），提高稳定性",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "mpu6050-rm",
        "page": 41,
        "section": "4.30 PWR_MGMT_1 / CLKSEL",
        "quote": "PLL with X axis gyroscope reference"
      },
      "tier": "official_mirror",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MPU-004",
      "kind": "peripheral",
      "scope": [
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "上电默认时钟源是内部 8MHz 振荡器，未改 CLKSEL 前不要指望数据稳定",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "mpu6050-rm",
        "page": 41,
        "section": "4.30 PWR_MGMT_1",
        "quote": "Upon power up, the MPU-60X0 clock source defaults to the internal oscillator."
      },
      "tier": "official_mirror",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R-MPU-005",
      "kind": "register",
      "scope": [
        "mpu6050"
      ],
      "text": "要读温度时把 PWR_MGMT_1 的 TEMP_DIS 位清 0（该位置 1 即关闭温度传感器）",
      "cite": {
        "doc": "mpu6050-rm",
        "page": 42,
        "section": "4.30 PWR_MGMT_1 / TEMP_DIS",
        "quote": "TEMP_DIS When set to 1, this bit disables the temperature sensor."
      },
      "tier": "official_mirror",
      "status": "approved",
      "check": null,
      "notes": [
        "规则模式 unverified：未核对"
      ]
